{"id":"83eb2b67a65ec154","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-constructible-universe.md","title":"Constructible Universe L","display":"df-constructible-universe — Constructible Universe L","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-constructible-universe","aliases":["92-df-constructible-universe","92-df-L"],"display":"df-constructible-universe — Constructible Universe L","depends_on":["[[92-df-zfc]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]","[[92-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-constructible-universe"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-constructible-universe</span><span>92-df-L</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-constructible-universe — Constructible Universe L"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66c9470f107a6bad\" href=\"?note=66c9470f107a6bad\" title=\"92-df-zfc\">92-df-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"afb378126cbf5f83\" href=\"?note=afb378126cbf5f83\" title=\"92-df-ordinal\">92-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (class of ordinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lim}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lim}\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}\\)</span> (formulas and free-variable function for the first-order language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\in\\}\">\\(\\{\\in\\}\\)</span>; language-indexed analogues of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\in}\">\\(\\models_{\\in}\\)</span> (satisfaction for membership structures, the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\in\\}\">\\(\\{\\in\\}\\)</span>-language instance of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\in)\\models_{\\in}\\varphi[x,\\vec a]\">\\((X,\\in)\\models_{\\in}\\varphi[x,\\vec a]\\)</span> abbreviates satisfaction under the assignment <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\mapsto x\">\\(v_0\\mapsto x\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\\mapsto a_i\">\\(v_i\\mapsto a_i\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq i\\leq n\">\\(1\\leq i\\leq n\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}(X),L_\\alpha,L\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}(X),L_\\alpha,L\\)</span> (definition targets)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}universe} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Def}(X)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\Bigl\\{Y\\subseteq X\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in X^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl[x\\in Y\\Longleftrightarrow(X,\\in)\\models_{\\in}\\varphi[x,\\vec a]\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\nL_0\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\emptyset,\\\\\nL_{\\alpha+1}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\operatorname{Def}(L_\\alpha)\\qquad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}),\\\\\nL_\\lambda\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}L_\\beta\\qquad(\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)),\\\\\nL\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{x\\mid\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(x\\in L_\\alpha)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}universe} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Def}(X)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\Bigl\\{Y\\subseteq X\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in X^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl[x\\in Y\\Longleftrightarrow(X,\\in)\\models_{\\in}\\varphi[x,\\vec a]\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\nL_0\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\emptyset,\\\\\nL_{\\alpha+1}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\operatorname{Def}(L_\\alpha)\\qquad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}),\\\\\nL_\\lambda\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}L_\\beta\\qquad(\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)),\\\\\nL\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{x\\mid\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(x\\in L_\\alpha)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可构造宇宙<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}(X)\\)</span>必须允许来自<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>的有限参数；只取无参数可定义子集不会得到标准构造层级</li>\n<li>在通常集合论元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>是包含全部序数的传递真类；它不是集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span>：第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>层的构造</li>\n<li>每个后继层只加入在前一层的成员结构上可由有限层内参数定义的子集</li>\n<li>若环境宇宙满足ZF，则其构造内宇宙<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>满足ZFC以及GCH，因而满足CH</li>\n<li>相容性结论都应相对表述：构造<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>给出相应的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZF})\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+V=L+\\mathrm{GCH})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZF})\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+V=L+\\mathrm{GCH})\\)</span>论证；forcing则在适当模型假设下给出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\neq L\">\\(V\\neq L\\)</span>等相对相容性结果</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"66c9470f107a6bad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ordinal","stat